  "auth.autoLogin.twoFactorTitle": "VRChat 要求二步驟驗證",
  "auth.autoLogin.twoFactorMessage": "無法自動完成重新登入。請開啟 AntiBot，在「帳號」頁面輸入驗證碼。",
  "Sign out": "登出",
  "Keep the session between launches": "在啟動之間保留工作階段",
  "Only the VRChat session cookie is stored, never your password. Every mode except \"Do not remember\" encrypts it at rest; the difference is what unlocks it.": "只儲存 VRChat 工作階段 Cookie，絕不儲存密碼。除「不記住」外，所有模式都會加密儲存，差別在於解鎖方式。",
