  "Could not read the settings.": "無法讀取設定。",
  "Log source": "日誌來源",
  "configurable": "可設定",
  "VRChat log folder": "VRChat 日誌資料夾",
  "VRChat's log folder": "VRChat 日誌資料夾",
  "The newest log in this folder is followed while VRChat is running. Nothing is read while it is closed.": "VRChat 執行時跟隨此資料夾中最新的日誌。關閉時不會讀取。",
  "Open folder": "開啟資料夾",
  "Use VRChat's folder": "使用 VRChat 的資料夾",
  "Avatar name lookups": "頭像名稱查詢",
  "same format as VRCX": "與 VRCX 相同格式",
  "API endpoints": "API 端點",
  "Tried in order; the first name wins. Each is called as": "依序嘗試，第一個名稱優先。呼叫格式：",
  "and must answer with JSON containing a": "並且必須回傳包含以下欄位的 JSON：",
  "No endpoint; avatar names stay unknown.": "沒有端點；頭像名稱將保持未知。",
  "Avatar API endpoint": "頭像 API 端點",
  "Remove endpoint": "移除端點",
  "New avatar API endpoint": "新的頭像 API 端點",
  "Add": "新增",
  "Automatic protection": "自動保護",
  "Threat threshold": "威脅度門檻",
  "Any user at or above this score is acted on; the score is a guess and can be wrong. Friends and whitelisted users are never acted on.": "達到此分數的使用者會被執行以下操作。分數只是推測，可能會有誤判。好友與白名單使用者永遠不會被處理。",
  "Block the user": "封鎖使用者",
  "Block the user. VRChat may then refuse to send them your avatar if it checks blocks on the server; it may also have no effect.": "封鎖該使用者。如果 VRChat 在伺服器端檢查封鎖關係，可能會拒絕把您的頭像傳送給對方；但也可能沒有效果。",
  "Disable avatar interactions": "關閉頭像互動",
  "Turn the user's avatar interactions off, so their avatar cannot trigger anything on yours.": "關閉該使用者的頭像互動，避免對方的頭像對您的頭像觸發任何東西。",
  "Hide the chat box": "隱藏聊天框",
  "Hide the user's chat box, so they cannot flood or harass through it.": "隱藏該使用者的聊天框，避免洗頻和騷擾。",
  "Close VRChat": "關閉 VRChat",
  "Close VRChat, so the client has as little chance as possible to download and cache their avatar.": "關閉 VRChat，盡量讓客戶端沒有機會下載並快取對方的頭像。",
  "When VRChat really quits, the OSC actions are skipped because there is nothing left to protect.": "VRChat 真的結束後，OSC 操作會被跳過，因為已經沒有需要保護的東西了。",
  "Skip while in VR": "VR 模式下跳過",
  "Do not close VRChat while a VR headset is in use; quitting from VR is disruptive.": "使用 VR 頭戴裝置時不關閉 VRChat，因為在 VR 中結束很麻煩。",
  "Closed VRChat": "已關閉 VRChat",
  "Asks VRChat to quit normally, so the client tells the instance it is leaving.": "正常關閉 VRChat，客戶端會通知實例自己已離開。",
  "VRChat closed.": "已關閉 VRChat。",
  "VRChat did not close. Is it running?": "VRChat 沒有關閉。它是否在執行？",
  "Safe Mode (OSC)": "安全模式",
  "Turn on VRChat's Safe Mode over OSC when a user reaches the threshold, so every non-friend avatar is replaced at once. It needs OSC enabled in VRChat and stays on until you turn it off.": "出現達到閾值的使用者時，透過 OSC 開啟 VRChat 的安全模式，一次替換所有非好友的頭像。需要在 VRChat 中啟用 OSC，並且會一直保持開啟直到你手動關閉。",
  "Safe Mode on": "安全模式已開啟",
  "Safe Mode request sent.": "已傳送安全模式要求。",
  "VRChat is not listening for OSC. Enable it in the Action Menu.": "VRChat 沒有在監聽 OSC，請在快捷選單中啟用。",
  "Presses VRChat's panic button over OSC, which replaces every non-friend avatar at once.": "透過 OSC 按下 VRChat 的緊急按鈕，一次替換所有非好友的頭像。",
  "Switch avatar (OSC)": "切換頭像",
  "Switch to another avatar over OSC when a user reaches the threshold. It is not switched back.": "出現達到閾值的使用者時，透過 OSC 切換到另一個頭像。不會自動換回。",
  "Safe avatar id": "安全頭像 ID",
  "Only avatars in your favourites, your recents or your own uploads can be used. Paste the avatar's link or its id (avtr_…).": "只能使用收藏、最近使用或自己上傳的頭像。請貼上頭像的連結或 ID（avtr_…）。",
  "Show the avatar id": "顯示頭像 ID",
  "Hide the avatar id": "隱藏頭像 ID",
  "Switched avatar": "已切換頭像",
  "Avatar changed.": "已切換頭像。",
  "Already wearing that avatar.": "已經是該頭像了。",
  "Set the avatar id in the settings first.": "請先在設定中填寫頭像 ID。",
  "Asks VRChat to wear the avatar id from the settings.": "要求 VRChat 換上設定中填寫的頭像。",
