  "OSC port": "OSC 連接埠",
  "VRChat listens on 9000 unless it was started with a custom --osc port.": "除非 VRChat 使用自訂 --osc 連接埠啟動，否則它監聽 9000。",
  "VRChat reports port {detected}; AntiBot sends to {port}.": "VRChat 回報的是連接埠 {detected}，但 AntiBot 正傳送到 {port}。",
  "Test connection": "測試連線",
