  "Opens VRChat's Quick Menu when OSC is working.": "如果 OSC 正常，VRChat 的快捷選單會開啟。",
  "VRChat is advertising OSC on port {port}.": "VRChat 正在連接埠 {port} 上公開 OSC。",
  "VRChat is not advertising OSC. Enable it in the Action Menu.": "VRChat 沒有公開 OSC，請在快捷選單中啟用。",
  "Sent to port {port}. If the Quick Menu opened, OSC is working.": "已傳送到連接埠 {port}。如果快捷選單開啟了，代表 OSC 正常。",
