  "Working…": "執行中…",
  "Reject friend requests": "拒絕好友邀請",
  "Reject friend requests from any user at or above the threshold. VRChat's notification is hidden and only the block, avatar interaction and chat box actions are applied to the sender; the request stays in AntiBot's list as rejected, where it can be undone.": "拒絕達到閾值的使用者送來的好友邀請。VRChat 的通知會被隱藏，只對寄件者套用封鎖、關閉頭像互動和隱藏聊天框；邀請仍會以「已拒絕」保留在 AntiBot 的清單中，可以在那裡復原。",
